        `i + 1`, which corresponds to spatial dimension `i`.  It is required that
        `block_shape[i]` divides `input_shape[i + 1] + pad_start + pad_end`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A `Tensor`. Has the same type as `input`.

